# Confirm a new email with the token from the link. Start the API with Aspire first.
@host = http://localhost:5279
@token = paste-the-token-from-the-email

### A valid token → 204. Used again or expired → 404. Taken since the link was sent → 409 user.email_taken.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/email-changes/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{token}}"
}
